 "manufacturer": "Zhuhai Hongjiacheng Technology",
 "title": "Bidirectional 5 V ultra-low-capacitance ESD protection diode, SOD-523",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev 2.0",
  "pages": 3
 },
 "summary": "A two-terminal bidirectional TVS diode in SOD-523 with 0.3 pF typical junction capacitance. It stands off 5 V, breaks down between 6 V and 10 V at 1 mA and leaks no more than 0.2 µA at 5 V. It is rated for ±15 kV air and contact discharge to IEC 61000-4-2 and a 5 A 8/20 µs surge to IEC 61000-4-5, clamping at 25 V or below at that current. Listed uses: phones and their accessories, PDAs, notebooks, handheld and portable instruments, digital cameras, peripherals, audio players and industrial equipment.",
